*-----------------Build Variables------------------*

dr_blkt_inboard = 0.0 * inboard blanket thickness (m); (calculated if `blktmodel>0`) (=0;0 if `i_blkt_inboard=0`)
dr_blkt_outboard = 0.7 * outboard blanket thickness (m); calculated if `blktmodel>0`
dr_bore  = 0.100007075080093 * Machine centre bore gap inboard radius (m) (`iteration variable 29`)
dr_vv_inboard = 0.0 * vacuum vessel inboard thickness (TF coil / shield) (m)
dr_vv_outboard = 0.3 * vacuum vessel outboard thickness (TF coil / shield) (m)
dz_vv_upper = 0.3 * vacuum vessel topside thickness (TF coil / shield) (m) (= dz_vv_lower if double-null)
dz_vv_lower = 0.3 * vacuum vessel underside thickness (TF coil / shield) (m)
dr_shld_vv_gap_inboard = 0.0 * gap between inboard vacuum vessel and thermal shield (m) (`iteration variable 61`)
dr_cs_tf_gap = 0.0 * gap between central solenoid and TF coil (m) (`iteration variable 42`)
gapomin  = 0.0 * minimum gap between outboard vacuum vessel and TF coil (m) (`iteration variable 31`)
i_cs_use = 0 * Switch for existence of central solenoid;
i_cs_precomp = 0 * Switch for existence of central solenoid pre-compression structure;
dr_cs    = 0.030006455159940094 * Central solenoid radial thickness (m) (`iteration variable 16`)
dr_fw_plasma_gap_inboard = 0.05840127797682061 * Gap between plasma and first wall; inboard side (m) (if `i_plasma_wall_gap=1`)
dr_fw_plasma_gap_outboard = 0.12 * Gap between plasma and first wall; outboard side (m) (if `i_plasma_wall_gap=1`)
dr_shld_inboard = 0.010006326403004914 * inboard shield thickness (m) (`iteration variable 93`)
dr_shld_outboard = 0.25 * outboard shield thickness (m) (`iteration variable 94`)
dz_shld_upper = 0.2 * upper/lower shield thickness (m); calculated if `blktmodel > 0` (= dz_shld_lower if double-null)
f_dr_tf_outboard_inboard = 1.0 * TF coil outboard leg / inboard leg radial thickness
dr_shld_thermal_inboard = 0.0 * TF-VV thermal shield thickness; inboard (m)
dr_shld_thermal_outboard = 0.0 * TF-VV thermal shield thickness; outboard (m)
dz_shld_thermal = 0.0 * TF-VV thermal shield thickness; vertical build (m)
dz_shld_vv_gap = 0.0 * vertical gap between vacuum vessel and thermal shields (m)
dz_xpoint_divertor = 0.5 * vertical gap between x-point and divertor (m) (if = 0; it is calculated)
dr_shld_blkt_gap = 0.0 * gap between vacuum vessel and blanket (m)

