beta_poloidal_eps_max = 10.0 * maximum (eps*beta_poloidal) (`constraint equation 6`); Note; revised issue #346
f_nd_plasma_pedestal_greenwald = 0.10000000000330746 * Greenwald fraction of the pedestal density
f_nd_plasma_separatrix_greenwald = 0.001000000000729119 * Greenwald fraction of the separatrix density
hfact    = 2.9999999997149764 * H factor on energy confinement times; radiation corrected (`iteration variable 10`);
i_bootstrap_current = 3 * switch for bootstrap current scaling
i_beta_component = 0 * switch for beta limit scaling (`constraint equation 24`)
i_plasma_current = 9 * switch for plasma current scaling to use
i_diamagnetic_current = 2 * switch for diamagnetic current scaling
i_density_limit = 7 * switch for density limit to enforce (`constraint equation 5`)
i_plasma_pedestal = 1 * switch for pedestal profiles;
i_pfirsch_schluter_current = 1 * switch for Pfirsch-Schlüter current scaling (issue #413);
radius_plasma_pedestal_density_norm = 0.94 * PPlasma normalised radius of density pedestal (ρₙ;pedestal)  (`i_plasma_pedestal==1`)
radius_plasma_pedestal_temp_norm = 0.94 * Plasma normalised radius of temperature pedestal (ρₜ;pedestal) (`i_plasma_pedestal==1`)
tbeta    = 2.0 * Plasma temperature profile index beta (βₜ)  (`i_plasma_pedestal==1)
temp_plasma_pedestal_electron_kev = 5.5 * Plasma electron temperature of pedestal (Tₑ;pedestal) [keV] (`i_plasma_pedestal==1`)
temp_plasma_separatrix_electron_kev = 0.1 * Plasma electron temperature at separatrix (Tₑ;ₛₑₚ) [keV] (`i_plasma_pedestal==1`) calculated if reinke
i_plasma_geometry = 8 * switch for plasma elongation and triangularity calculations;
itart    = 1 * switch for spherical tokamak (ST) models;
kappa    = 2.75 * Plasma separatrix elongation (κₐ)  (calculated if `i_plasma_geometry = 1-5; 7 or 9-10`)
q0       = 2.0 * Plasma safety factor on axis (q₀)
q95      = 6.10000000003175 * Plasma safety factor at 95% flux surface (q₉₅) (`iteration variable 18`)
molflow_plasma_fuelling = 2.8275435268360435e+21 * plasma fuelling rate (nucleus-pairs/s)
f_nd_alpha_thermal_electron = 0.0010000000001496665 * Thermal alpha density/electron density (⟨n_αₜₕ⟩/⟨nₑ⟩)
ind_plasma_internal_norm = 0.65 * Plasma normalised internal inductance
rmajor   = 1.7 * Plasma major radius (R₀) [m] (`iteration variable 3`)
f_nd_beam_electron = 1.00000005216557e-06 * hot beam density / n_e (`iteration variable 7`)
i_single_null = 0 * switch for single null / double null plasma;
f_sync_reflect = 0.7 * synchrotron wall reflectivity factor
temp_plasma_electron_vol_avg_kev = 16.017101285439175 * Plasma volume averaged electron temperature (⟨Tₑ⟩) [keV] (`iteration variable 4`)
f_temp_plasma_ion_electron = 1.35 * Plasma ratio of ion temperature to electron temperature (used to calculate temp_plasma_ion_vol_avg_kev if `f_temp_plasma_ion_electron > 0;0`)
triang   = 0.5 * Plasma separatrix triangularity (δₐ) (calculated if `i_plasma_geometry = 1; 3-5 or 7`)

